    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I’ve always found math practical and useful, especially in everyday problem-solving. My vocational training gave me a solid foundation, and I enjoy applying it to real-world tasks like budgeting or analyzing data. It’s not my favorite subject, but I appreciate its logical structure and how it helps me think clearly.",
