    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Yes, I used an AI tool last year to check my homework. It provided clear explanations for problems I struggled with, like solving quadratic equations. The tool was helpful but I had to make sure I understood the steps before relying on it. It’s a great supplement, not a replacement.",
