    "According to you, how can LLMs be used to innovate math learning in schools and universities?": "LLMs can personalize learning by adapting to individual student needs, providing instant feedback on problems, and explaining concepts in simple terms. They can also generate practice problems tailored to a student’s level, making math more engaging and accessible without overwhelming them with complexity."
